## A user config file (c2.yaml renamed to r2.yaml) read by both tools: YAML 1.1
## spellings, custom attributes and mechanisms, unknown keys (warnings go to the log).
## config: user_config.yaml
config path
config show
config show --origin
providers
load mem aes 000102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f --label k
encrypt mem:k ecb 0x00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff
ops mem
exit
